WEBVTT

00:03.870 --> 00:05.890
As you wish...

00:06.330 --> 00:10.140
I will send you to your death along with Monado!

00:27.490 --> 00:28.150
Eins.

00:33.660 --> 00:34.720
Eins!

00:36.560 --> 00:38.060
Stay with me.

00:40.700 --> 00:43.200
Before the presence of a god,

00:43.200 --> 00:46.310
you're being controlled by something as worthless as

00:46.310 --> 00:49.000
loyalty to your master, Eins.

00:51.580 --> 00:55.980
Very well. I grant death to you fools!

00:57.990 --> 00:59.480
Stop!

01:19.010 --> 01:20.980
When did I first notice

01:20.980 --> 01:23.010
That your fingers were

01:23.010 --> 01:26.680
So beautiful

01:26.950 --> 01:30.680
And when did I notice this feeling?

01:30.990 --> 01:33.960
So fast that I'll be run over

01:33.960 --> 01:36.590
I cannot keep up

01:36.590 --> 01:39.930
My fearful heart

01:39.930 --> 01:42.690
Puts on the brakes

01:43.100 --> 01:45.500
Our eyes meet

01:46.370 --> 01:47.470
We talk about something

01:47.470 --> 01:50.700
When you look at me

01:50.970 --> 01:55.410
I cannot move

01:57.050 --> 02:04.710
My beating heart is about to break

02:04.990 --> 02:08.960
The arms that catch me pull me

02:08.960 --> 02:12.990
I can't suppress it, I can't express it

02:12.990 --> 02:17.660
That I like you

02:18.000 --> 02:20.970
So much it hurts

02:20.970 --> 02:28.710
The beginning of a love that won't let me breathe

02:37.690 --> 02:38.650
Eins...

02:47.100 --> 02:48.090
Eins.

02:55.100 --> 02:59.110
The

02:55.100 --> 02:59.110
Eternal

02:55.100 --> 02:59.110
Pledge

02:55.800 --> 03:00.100
My name is Leif Helluland.

03:02.880 --> 03:03.870
Demon,

03:06.480 --> 03:09.780
protect what is precious to you.

03:20.300 --> 03:21.190
Leif...

03:23.800 --> 03:26.790
Protect what is precious to you?

03:29.340 --> 03:30.540
What's funny?

03:30.540 --> 03:35.510
I was just thinking, what ironic words for you...

03:35.510 --> 03:38.810
who are about to lose everything.

03:38.810 --> 03:39.880
What did you say?

03:39.880 --> 03:43.820
You can no longer stand against me.

03:45.190 --> 03:49.850
My strength has reached the height of gods.

03:52.030 --> 03:55.860
How long have I waited for this moment.

03:56.530 --> 04:00.230
I've lived 400 years for it.

04:00.770 --> 04:01.790
400 years?

04:02.100 --> 04:05.710
For the first 100 years, I lived for people.

04:05.710 --> 04:11.840
But people persecuted me, saying that magic was evil.

04:13.250 --> 04:17.420
Since then, I've become more than human,

04:17.420 --> 04:21.320
and decided to rule the world with the power of the gods.

04:22.420 --> 04:26.530
Eventually, I learned of the existence of the Artifact,

04:26.530 --> 04:30.270
and in order to obtain it, looked into this village,

04:30.270 --> 04:33.330
at times visiting it myself.

04:34.440 --> 04:37.240
And there I had the satisfaction

04:37.240 --> 04:42.040
of seeing the snake's mother drowning in a swamp as a sacrifice.

04:42.610 --> 04:43.670
I see.

04:44.250 --> 04:47.370
So that's why you had her made in my mother's image.

04:49.920 --> 04:52.190
I now understand how someone

04:52.190 --> 04:56.120
as fundamentally twisted as you could think of something like that.

04:56.120 --> 04:59.930
I'm glad you enjoyed it.

05:00.330 --> 05:01.520
Scum.

05:02.600 --> 05:05.620
To think that someone like you is one of the four wise men.

05:06.470 --> 05:08.800
Logos must be corrupt to its very roots.

05:08.800 --> 05:12.410
And what a help it was that the holy woman raised by Logos

05:12.410 --> 05:19.410
obeyed my every order as long as I said it was foretold by the Black Book.

05:19.410 --> 05:20.150
What?

05:20.150 --> 05:21.120
One more thing.

05:21.780 --> 05:24.050
To steal the Artifact,

05:24.050 --> 05:29.820
I absolutely needed a holy woman who bore the same role as Sibyl.

05:29.820 --> 05:34.160
To obtain the child, I killed the mother and raised her myself.

05:35.330 --> 05:39.170
At the moment that child obtained the Artifact,

05:39.170 --> 05:42.100
I revived the mother and it appeared that she

05:42.100 --> 05:44.160
wanted to see her for a moment.

05:47.140 --> 05:49.110
But fear not.

05:49.840 --> 05:54.850
Soon they'll be warmly welcoming you to the other world!

05:54.850 --> 05:57.220
What have you done?

05:57.220 --> 05:58.550
You...

05:58.550 --> 06:00.180
You're rotten to the core.

06:00.490 --> 06:01.820
Aria.

06:03.490 --> 06:05.260
Now do you understand?

06:05.860 --> 06:09.520
I, Melchizedek, am Logos!

06:09.830 --> 06:12.530
You alone I cannot forgive,

06:12.900 --> 06:14.530
Melchizedek.

06:19.140 --> 06:24.080
Hatred. Sadness. Despair. Wrath.

06:25.110 --> 06:27.110
All will become my power.

06:29.920 --> 06:35.950
Power of the gods, be absorbed by my body!

06:36.490 --> 06:39.460
Shut it! Stop spouting nonsense!

06:39.890 --> 06:41.160
Tamaki, stand back.

06:41.560 --> 06:43.390
Vier, Aria.

06:44.870 --> 06:48.500
Show them your power!

06:54.580 --> 06:57.810
Die!

07:12.790 --> 07:18.730
I will become a god and purge the world of the foolish human race.

07:42.790 --> 07:47.560
What you saw when the seal on the
Artifact was broken is everything.

07:48.900 --> 07:54.560
I possess the power to realize the fears and wishes of all things.

08:01.810 --> 08:05.750
When possessed by the weak, they are tossed about by power.

08:06.810 --> 08:09.370
But my will has won.

08:09.850 --> 08:13.340
My wish has been granted and I am a god.

08:13.990 --> 08:17.080
Now, come with me, Sibyl.

08:19.160 --> 08:20.090
Come!

08:20.830 --> 08:23.590
In order to completely control the Onikirimaru,

08:24.300 --> 08:27.890
you must want the Tamayori's,
Tamaki's power.

08:29.470 --> 08:34.810
To walk with gods, that is the only path left for you!

08:35.880 --> 08:36.900
Stop messing around!

08:37.880 --> 08:40.350
I won't hand her over to anyone!

08:40.950 --> 08:41.810
Takuma.

08:42.320 --> 08:43.680
Like Takuma said.

08:44.390 --> 08:46.220
We have no intention of running.

08:46.220 --> 08:47.450
We'll fight to the end!

08:48.620 --> 08:49.450
Everyone...

08:51.360 --> 08:55.660
Even if a hundred of you attacked me together,

08:55.660 --> 08:57.830
you would no longer be an opponent to me!

08:58.400 --> 08:59.420
That's not true.

09:00.540 --> 09:05.000
I don't think that going with you is my only path.

09:05.640 --> 09:06.870
I believe in everyone.

09:07.640 --> 09:10.340
So you defy a god, Sibyl?

09:11.150 --> 09:16.610
Very well. Then taste the wrath of the gods!

09:19.090 --> 09:21.060
Thank you, Tamaki.

09:21.560 --> 09:24.050
No, Tamayori princess.

09:24.760 --> 09:28.230
We will fight alongside your beliefs.

09:28.230 --> 09:28.860
Yeah.

09:29.560 --> 09:32.560
If that's a god, then let us bury the gods.

09:32.970 --> 09:35.100
Well said, Tamaki.

09:35.100 --> 09:36.970
If I'm with you, I can do it.

09:37.510 --> 09:41.110
I'll believe you, too, Tamaki.

09:41.110 --> 09:44.480
That's the Tamayori princess I always saw in you.

09:45.510 --> 09:47.740
Let's end it this time.

09:50.280 --> 09:51.310
Okay.

09:52.090 --> 09:53.550
I'm counting on you guys!

09:54.120 --> 09:54.920
Go!

09:57.790 --> 09:58.790
Here we go.

09:58.790 --> 09:59.690
All right!

10:07.570 --> 10:08.900
Vanish!

10:15.210 --> 10:17.410
Manifold emergence!

10:23.550 --> 10:24.920
I'll destroy you...

10:25.750 --> 10:27.690
and your power!

10:39.270 --> 10:40.290
Stop!

10:47.780 --> 10:51.740
Flames, engulf, burn!

11:06.660 --> 11:07.600
Yuichi!

11:07.600 --> 11:08.320
Homura!

11:15.000 --> 11:20.810
<i>Tamayori princess power within, show yourself to me.</i>

11:40.560 --> 11:43.000
I won't hold back any longer.

11:43.000 --> 11:46.960
Despair before my power!

11:49.540 --> 11:52.030
I don't think so!

11:52.840 --> 11:54.500
Here we go!

11:58.280 --> 12:00.010
Petty tricks!

12:00.550 --> 12:05.280
Engulfing flames, incinerate all that stands before me!

12:09.990 --> 12:12.480
Infinite engine, emerge!

12:23.700 --> 12:26.900
Give me power for Tamayori!

12:41.460 --> 12:44.150
Evil winds, disperse!

12:55.640 --> 12:58.370
Return to the Underworld!

13:06.780 --> 13:12.410
Why? Why?! I am a god!

13:37.010 --> 13:38.100
Onikirimaru.

13:38.750 --> 13:42.410
Even after we defeat him, the Onikirimaru remains?

13:51.430 --> 13:52.830
Thank you, everyone.

13:53.630 --> 13:55.150
I'll take care of the rest.

14:01.900 --> 14:03.060
Onikirimaru.

14:04.000 --> 14:06.000
In an attempt to suppress that power,

14:06.840 --> 14:09.640
many lives have been lost, and in an attempt...

14:10.240 --> 14:12.770
to control it, many fights have been had.

14:14.750 --> 14:15.910
That sort of power...

14:16.720 --> 14:18.280
That sort of power is unneeded.

14:19.020 --> 14:22.150
The Onikirimaru must not exist in this world.

14:23.790 --> 14:24.950
Please,

14:28.500 --> 14:29.860
disappear.

15:17.780 --> 15:18.840
It's morning.

15:19.580 --> 15:21.550
Yes, it's morning.

15:22.620 --> 15:24.310
It's all over now, isn't it?

15:25.090 --> 15:28.890
Yes. You ended it.

15:31.560 --> 15:32.690
Don't cry.

15:33.330 --> 15:35.660
Everything painful is over.

15:35.930 --> 15:37.460
That's not it.

15:37.460 --> 15:39.830
These are happy tears.

15:40.230 --> 15:42.640
I'm so glad, I really am,

15:42.640 --> 15:44.630
that you and the others are alive.

15:45.640 --> 15:46.610
You, too.

15:54.450 --> 15:57.720
The Onikirimaru has vanished from this world.

15:57.720 --> 16:00.980
With this, we've been released from our duty.

16:01.520 --> 16:02.290
Yes.

16:03.190 --> 16:06.460
Thank you, Tamaki.

16:06.460 --> 16:08.290
But, I...

16:08.700 --> 16:11.720
All I did was wish for it gone.

16:13.230 --> 16:15.760
The power to turn wishes into reality.

16:17.540 --> 16:19.110
To wish for it gone...

16:19.110 --> 16:24.100
You may be the first Tamayori princess to have wished that.

16:26.850 --> 16:29.780
That's why she's our Tamayori princess.

16:30.280 --> 16:33.450
She sure was unreliable in the beginning.

16:34.020 --> 16:36.490
But you've really turned out to be a great princess.

16:37.320 --> 16:39.120
Mahiro.

16:39.460 --> 16:42.330
I'm glad I was able to be your guardian.

16:42.930 --> 16:44.470
Yes, that's true.

16:44.470 --> 16:46.760
Thank you, Tamaki.

16:47.200 --> 16:49.330
I was saved by you, as well.

16:49.800 --> 16:52.410
Cut it out. Suguru, not you, too.

16:52.410 --> 16:53.540
Me, too.

16:53.540 --> 16:57.440
How saved I was by your bright and optimistic smile.

16:58.350 --> 17:00.940
But now that the Onikirimaru is gone,

17:01.580 --> 17:04.520
we guardians may no longer be needed.

17:05.350 --> 17:06.620
No.

17:06.620 --> 17:10.990
Now that this has happened, the Bureau might reappear.

17:11.930 --> 17:14.590
There's a need to keep an eye on Ashiya.

17:15.200 --> 17:17.700
There's still plenty to do.

17:17.700 --> 17:19.860
That's right, Yuichi.

17:22.040 --> 17:23.030
I see.

17:23.770 --> 17:26.000
Though the Onikirimaru may be gone,

17:26.640 --> 17:28.840
we guardians will continue to live,

17:28.840 --> 17:33.010
protecting the Tamayori princess by our own will.

17:33.680 --> 17:36.280
Tamaki, is that all right?

17:37.220 --> 17:37.980
Yes.

17:40.220 --> 17:41.690
I hope you will.

17:44.290 --> 17:47.060
Sibyl, I am grateful to you.

17:51.730 --> 17:52.560
Aria?

17:59.610 --> 18:01.110
Mitsuru,

18:01.110 --> 18:04.200
today Tamaki goes back to town.

18:05.110 --> 18:08.210
Her parents are returning from overseas.

18:14.190 --> 18:16.420
Kifu village will be lonely.

18:22.030 --> 18:23.000
Offering?

18:24.130 --> 18:27.590
Just a moment. Today I have lots.

18:32.410 --> 18:32.960
Offering?

18:34.710 --> 18:36.540
Not O-chan!

18:36.540 --> 18:37.640
Not that way.

18:39.610 --> 18:42.950
That was the first thing
I said to you, wasn't it?

18:43.350 --> 18:44.280
Takuma!

18:44.990 --> 18:47.290
But don't you have school?

18:47.290 --> 18:48.120
I skipped.

18:49.320 --> 18:51.790
You shouldn't skip class!

18:52.090 --> 18:58.660
Seeing you off is far more important than class to me.

19:02.270 --> 19:03.940
Class?

19:03.940 --> 19:05.810
You're always sleeping anyway.

19:05.810 --> 19:07.070
My bad.

19:07.440 --> 19:08.530
No.

19:09.640 --> 19:10.510
Thank you.

19:11.110 --> 19:12.510
Come back soon.

19:13.650 --> 19:17.610
You'll be protecting the Tamayori shrine from now on, right?

19:18.120 --> 19:21.660
Yes, because I'd like to continue to pass on

19:21.660 --> 19:23.920
the memories that
Grandma looked after.

19:24.890 --> 19:28.420
Come back before the red leaf rain ends.

19:38.970 --> 19:40.070
It's all right.

19:40.810 --> 19:45.380
I'll convince my mother and father and come back.

19:45.380 --> 19:46.070
Yeah.

19:50.580 --> 19:53.550
What are you two doing?

19:55.820 --> 19:59.120
Redhead, so you do have some balls.

19:59.330 --> 20:00.820
What did you say?!

20:04.830 --> 20:07.630
Tamaki, the bus will be arriving soon.

20:08.300 --> 20:09.570
Yes!

20:10.800 --> 20:11.830
O-chan...

20:13.570 --> 20:14.940
Don't worry.

20:15.410 --> 20:18.850
I'll look after O-chan until you return.

20:18.850 --> 20:20.180
Yuichi.

20:20.680 --> 20:22.480
Thank you very much.

20:22.480 --> 20:24.140
Wait for me, O-chan.

20:32.390 --> 20:37.230
Kore ga koi da to kizuita hi kara
Since the day I realized that this was love

20:37.860 --> 20:42.890
Kimi to jyozu ni hanasenaku nattakke
I stopped being able to talk to you well

20:43.670 --> 20:48.010
Ishikishite tomadotte
I was self-conscious and hesitant

20:48.780 --> 20:53.610
Okubyou de sugu shita wo muiteta
And like a coward, would quickly look down

20:54.110 --> 20:59.520
Sonna watashi no kokoro no kabe wo kimi wa
You broke down the walls around the heart

20:59.920 --> 21:04.930
Kowashite kureta yo ne
Of someone like me

21:04.930 --> 21:10.020
Ano toki dekiru yotte itte kureta kara
At that time, when you told me I could do it

21:10.300 --> 21:14.760
Mune no oku gyutto hibiite
Something throbbed deep inside my chest

21:15.070 --> 21:22.240
Ganbareru ki ga shita yo
I had a feeling I could do my best

21:23.210 --> 21:28.650
Koishikute naita hi mo
The days I cried and yearned

21:28.650 --> 21:34.250
Itoshikute fureta hi mo
And the days we dearly touched

21:34.490 --> 21:44.490
Wasurenai yo ima mo zutto kagayaiteru yo
I won't forget, now and forever, they shine

21:45.000 --> 21:50.470
Tonari de waratta hi mo
The days we laughed together

21:50.470 --> 21:56.280
Tooku de negatta hi mo
And the days I prayed from far away

21:56.280 --> 22:01.380
Kimi to shitta kimochi subete ga
All the feelings I felt for the first time with you

22:01.380 --> 22:09.690
Daiji na takaramono
Are precious treasures

22:17.700 --> 22:26.440
Kienai takaramono
Never vanishing treasures

22:26.570 --> 22:28.270
What a beautiful sunset.

22:28.640 --> 22:29.980
Yeah.

22:29.980 --> 22:31.750
You were beautiful, too.

22:31.750 --> 22:32.950
Huh?

22:32.950 --> 22:36.110
At yesterday's offering dance.

22:36.780 --> 22:38.250
Especially the outfit.

22:38.420 --> 22:40.940
What? Seriously...

22:45.160 --> 22:48.820
I wonder if I became a proper Tamayori princess.

22:50.060 --> 22:53.030
Yeah. Even without a ceremony,

22:53.030 --> 22:55.830
you were a great Tamayori princess.

22:56.900 --> 22:58.170
Thank you, Takuma.

22:58.170 --> 23:00.570
It's a special occasion.

23:00.570 --> 23:02.200
Why don't you ask me for something?

23:03.010 --> 23:07.210
It's a guardian's duty to answer a princess' wishes.

23:12.590 --> 23:15.780
Stay by my side forever.

23:16.660 --> 23:17.920
Of course.

23:17.920 --> 23:20.420
I'll protect you all my life, Tamaki.

23:32.170 --> 23:33.970
It's been a while.

23:35.010 --> 23:38.750
It's been hard not being able to see you.

23:38.750 --> 23:41.750
What's this? Are you crying?

23:41.750 --> 23:43.840
When you're sad,

23:44.520 --> 23:46.150
I'll come see you.

23:46.150 --> 23:50.220
I'll find you wherever you are.

23:50.220 --> 23:55.160
It's a promise. We'll always be by your side.

23:58.430 --> 24:00.960
End
